 {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecodeAudio"}, "order": 34}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "VIDEO", "links": [260], "label": "VIDEO", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "VIDEO"}], "size": [270, 110], "pos": [454.1106262207031, 5178.421875], "widgets_values": [24, 8], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 258, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio", "link": 259, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "fps"}, "name": "fps", "label": "fps", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "fps"}, {"widget": {"name": "bit_depth"}, "shape": 7, "name": "bit_depth", "label": "bit_depth", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "bit_depth"}], "flags": {}, "id": 130, "type": "CreateVideo", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"fps": true, "bit_depth": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CreateVideo"}, "order": 35}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["MiniMax H3\nMiniMax H3是MiniMax的通用多模态生成模型。它可同时理解文本、图像、视频与音频，并可生成带有原生立体音频的视频：语音、音效和音乐在单次前向传播中完成联合建模，而非后期叠加。输出视频最高支持2K分辨率、24帧每秒，时长最高约15秒。\n\nComfyUI链接\n• ComfyUI#15224\n• 🤗 Comfy‑Org/MiniMax‑H3\n\n关于本工作流\n该模板使用MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo节点执行参考图转视频（ref2va）任务。可混合输入参考图像、参考视频以及独立音频，将这些素材融入生成过程，用以锁定人物特征、画面风格、动作、镜头运镜或是人声。\n\n主要输入项\n• ref_images / ref_videos / ref_video_audios / ref_audios：最多9张参考图像、3个参考视频（每个视频可自带配套音轨）以及3段独立参考音频片段\n• 提示词：按照输入连接的实际顺序，使用标签调用参考素材，例如<图片1>、<视频1>、<音频1>，随后描述目标场景、动作以及音频效果\n• ref_image_size：将参考素材缩放适配至生成分辨率（速度更快）；最大值模式会将图像短边最高保留至2048像素，获得更高的人物特征还原度，但会牺牲运行速度，因为参考特征token会参与每一步采样运算\n• width / height：通过分辨率选择器进行设置。\n• duration (seconds)：由数学表达式节点转换为有效帧长度\n\n采样与解码\n• 采样器：res_multistep。对于这类大量依赖参考素材的提示词，beta或normal调度器效果通常优于simple调度器\n• 采样器输出的音视频联合潜变量，直接分别送入VAE解码（视频，minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16）与VAE解码（音频，minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32）；两个解码节点会自动从打包的潜变量中提取各自对应部分。创建视频节点会将二者封装为音画同步的MP4文件\n• 本工作流所用扩散模型权重文件为minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors，与文本转视频/图像转视频模板所使用的fl2va模型权重不同\n\nref2va的生成结果对提示词措辞十分敏感；精准匹配参考标签，明确指定哪一份参考素材负责画面的哪一部分，通常可以得到最优效果。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax H3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [487.751953125, 599.8550415039062], "pos": [-2030, 4850], "id": 116, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["| megapixels | Aspect | Output (multiple=32) |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0.2 | 16:9 | 608 x 352 |\n| 0.3 | 16:9 | 736 x 416 |\n| 0.4 | 16:9 | 864 x 480 |\n| 0.5 | 16:9 | 960 x 544 |\n| 0.6 | 16:9 | 1056 x 608 |\n| 0.7 | 16:9 | 1152 x 640 |\n| 0.8 | 16:9 | 1216 x 672 |\n| 0.9 | 16:9 | 1280 x 736 |\n| 0.98 | 16:9 | 1344 x 768 |\n| 1.0 | 16:9 | 1376 x 768 |\n| 1.2 | 16:9 | 1504 x 832 |\n| 1.5 | 16:9 | 1664 x 928 |\n| 1.8 | 16:9 | 1824 x 1024 |\n| 2.0 | 16:9 | 1920 x 1088 |\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Size Settings Reference", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [260, 436.3636169433594], "pos": [-1804.293212890625, 5523.056640625], "id": 140, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}, {"name": "INT", "links": [275], "label": "INT", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "INT"}, {"name": "BOOL", "links": [], "label": "BOOL", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "BOOL"}], "size": [225, 74], "pos": [-1196.040283203125, 5794.06396484375], "widgets_values": ["max(5, round(a * 24)) + (5 - (max(5, round(a * 24)) % 17)) % 17"], "inputs": [{"name": "values.a", "link": 261, "label": "values.a", 