续真实运动。\n\n[Shot 1] 中远景，摄影机位于<Subject 1>左后方，以缓慢Tracking Shot跟随他沿<Subject 3>湿润小巷向前行走。<Subject 1>右手撑透明长柄雨伞，左肩背深蓝书包，步速自然。雨点连续敲击伞面，道路反射街灯。随着他向前，右侧自动贩卖机暖白灯光中逐渐显露<Subject 2>的银白长发与白色短披风。<Subject 1>注意到异常身影后脚步逐渐减慢，头部轻微转向右侧，视线锁定她。\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:07.200, the camera cuts to <Subject 1>肩后中景视角。<Subject 2>位于自动贩卖机前方约半米，背对偏侧摄影机站立，右手捏着一枚旧金色金币，正认真观察自动贩卖机投币口，左手自然靠近腰间法术书。她的银白发梢和披风被雨水轻微打湿。<Subject 1>从画面左侧前景停下，与她保持约3米距离。摄影机缓慢Push In，<Subject 2>此时仍未察觉他。结束时两人位置稳定。\n\noverall_soundscape:\n\n持续中雨、雨水敲击透明伞、远处城市低频环境声和鞋底踩过湿地的细小水声。自动贩卖机有低弱电流嗡鸣。\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n\n极轻的钢琴与柔和氛围合成器，约68 BPM，保持克制和微弱神秘感。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1500.9189453125, 5890.51416015625], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [261], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [13], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "视频时长", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [270, 70], "pos": [-1501.6766357421875, 5764.79150390625], "id": 132, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveFloat"}, "order": 14}, {"showAdvanced": false, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [276], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [277], "label": "he